StringData.data:
{color:#35a6e6}[Adrenaline]{color:end}
Killing Masters reset Sizuka's cooldowns.

{color:#35a6e6}[Bleed them Dry]{color:end}
Bleeding inflicted by Sizuka can stack up to 5 times. Each stack increases damage dealt by the Bleed effect.

Enter stealth for {skill:180030010:status:durationtime}.
Attacking, using a skill, or dodging will remove stealth.
{color:#e45f5f}Slowed by 10%.{color:end}

Instantly dashes to a target with a disorienting strike.
Causes a stack of bleeding with a small chance to stun. If Snap Strike is used while flanking, the chance to stun is greatly increased. Stuns last {skill:180030020:status:durationtime}.
{color:#e45f5f}Momentarily immune to incoming damage upon casting this skill.{color:end}

Throws {skill:180030030:leveltext:012:3:345:6:6:9} caltrops at a target area that slows for {skill:180030030:status:durationtime} by {skill:180030030:status:stat:mul:movespeed}% and bleeds enemies who step on them.
Sizuka jumps back slightly when using this skill.
{color:#e45f5f}Momentarily immune to incoming damage upon casting this skill.{color:end}

Sizuka dashes in and out of sight, slashing all enemies within range. Sizuka ends her ultimate where it began.
Targets can be struck multiple times.
{color:#e45f5f}When an enemy is repeatedly damaged, successive hits do 10% less damage up to a maximum of 40%.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Unstoppable Will]{color:end}
Koom gains Will when he deals or receives damage.
Koom heals 3% of his total HP and gains CC immunity for 1 second on skill activation.

Creates a shield around Koom for a short duration, absorbing {skill:180050030:status:stat:add:SHIELD_DEFENCE} damage.
After the shield's duration expires, or if the shield is broken, it explodes and deals {skill:180050030:status:explodebasedamage} damage to all enemies within {skill:180050030:status:targetingrange}. {color:#35a6e6}{color:end}The explosion deals up to {skill:180050030:status:explodeextradamage} bonus damage, based on how much it absorbed.
{color:#35a6e6}The shield persists through tagging.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Syphoning Blade]{color:end}
Death Knight's next attack recovers a small amount of HP once each second.

{color:#35a6e6}[Forever Damned]{color:end}
Death Knight will revive once upon reaching 0 HP.
After 3 sec, Death Knight respawns with 30% total HP.
{color:#e45f5f}Activation triggers a 5 min cool down, and the Death Knight is unable to move or attack while waiting to revive.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Rage Beast]{color:end}
Gains Rage, or RP, when dealing or receiving damage. 
All Cagnazzo's skills activate empowered effects by consuming a full RP bar on use.

Cagnazzo hurls his hook in a line, damaging struck enemies and dragging them back to Cagnazzo.

{color:#35a6e6}[Enraged]{color:end}
Increases damage by 30% and width by 0.8m.

Cagnazzo leaps to the target area, damaging and stunning all enemies he lands on for {skill:180080020:status:durationtime}. The damage and stun duration is increased closer to the center of the area.


{color:#35a6e6}[Enraged]{color:end}
Deals 30% additional damage and removes the distance-based stun and damage reductions.

Unleashes a battle roar that terrifies enemies within {skill:180080030:remote:range} for {skill:180080030:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Enraged]{color:end}
Deals 30% additional damage and causes terrified targets to take increased damage.

Brings down Karith's Fist in a heaving overhead swing, smashing enemies into the ground.

{color:#35a6e6}[Enraged]{color:end}
Deals 30% additional damage and depletes target's stamina.

{color:#35a6e6}[Robomoro]{color:end}
May have a maximum of 3 summoned robos at any given time.
Firing Moro's weapon attacks at friendly Robos heals them and restores Stamina to allied Masters.
{color:#e45f5f}Does not heal enemy robots.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Robo Go Go]{color:end}
Moro gains passive buffs when deploying Robos.
Robos drop a mana battery on death that restores 120 MP.
{color:#e45f5f}Both enemies and allies can pick up the battery.{color:end}

Deploys a robo that fires rockets at enemies.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo HP slowly drains once deployed.{color:end}

 {color:#35a6e6}[Robo Go Go]{color:end}
Moro's projectile speed is increased by {skill:180090010:status:stat:add:remotespeed:1}% for {skill:180090010:status:durationtime:1}.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo Gogo effects do not stack.{color:end}

Deploy a robot that fires and aerosolized carbon gel in a {skill:180090020:status:targetingrange} radius.
Enemy Masters within the area have their armaments coated with gel and cannot use weapon attacks while monsters lose 50% weapon damage.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo HP slowly drains once deployed.{color:end}

 {color:#35a6e6}[Robo Go Go]{color:end}
Increases Moro's Weapon Damage by {skill:180090020:status:stat:mul:attack:1}% for {skill:180090020:status:durationtime:1}.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo Go Go effects do not stack.{color:end}

Deploys a robo powered by a graviton singularity, heavily damaging and slowing enemies who pass through it for {skill:180090030:status:durationtime}.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo HP slowly drains once deployed.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Robo Go Go]{color:end}
Moro's Plasma Sieve is charged for {skill:180090030:status:durationtime:1}, slowing struck enemies by {skill:180090030:status:stat:mul:movespeed:2}% for {skill:180090030:status:durationtime:2}.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo Gogo effects do not stack.{color:end}

Deploys a medical robo that heals all allies within {skill:180090040:status:targetingrange}.
{color:#e45f5f}Robo HP slowly drains once deployed.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Robo Go Go]{color:end}
Restores {skill:180090040:status:regen:mul:health:1}% max HP when deployed.

After a brief delay, enemies crossing the glyph will trigger it and become bound. The glyph lasts for {skill:180100010:remote:lifetime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Instantly activates the glyph.

A rock fist bursts out of the glyph, launching enemies who trigger the glyph into the air while inflicting damage.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Instantly activates the glyph.

{color:#35a6e6}[Firing Stance]{color:end}
Using skills changes Vonak's stance and ammunition, transforming his weapon attack method.
Changing firing stances resets Vonak's overheat gauge.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Dance]{color:end}
Repeatedly changing stances within a short period of time gives stacking bonuses, up to 3 times. Each stance change increases MP cost.
 - Stage 1: +20% movespeed
 - Stage 2: +50% weapon projectile speed
 - Stage 3: +20% weapon damage
{color:#35a6e6}Stays active, even if tagged.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Unleashes a barrage of bullets in front of Vonak.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Rapidly fires both guns in a line directly ahead of Vonak.
Swapping to this stance resets overheat.

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Fires a wide arc of shots that strikes multiple targets.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Fires bullets in a cone that gradually widens and narrows over time.
Swapping to this stance resets overheat.

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Vonak fires a slew of bullets that follow a curved trajectory.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Fires curved shots that twist through the air.
Swapping to this stance resets overheat.

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Fires a burst of shots that knocks targets back.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Slowly fires powerful bursts that knock enemies back.
Swapping to this stance resets overheat.

{color:#35a6e6}[Soul Battery]{color:end}
Jinsoyun's sword acts as a Soul Battery, allowing her to store Soul Blades.
Able to harness 5 soul blades at a time. Each time a skill is used, Soul Blades are consumed to grant an additional effect.

{color:#35a6e6}[Spirit Recovery]{color:end}
A new Soul Blade is created every 2 weapon attacks, regardless of whether they strike a target or not.
A new Soul Blade is created each time Jinsoyun successfully avoids damage with her survival skill.

Launches enemies directly in front of you with an upward swipe, disabling stealth granted by brush for 3 seconds.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo: 2 Blades]{color:end}
Must recast to spend Soul Blades. Strike a target with an additional attack while they are launched.

Charges to the target area and inflicts damage to enemies.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo: 2 Blades]{color:end}
Automatically spends Soul Blades. Release an explosion of spiritual energy for additional damage. Targets struck by the explosion are bound for {skill:180120030:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Endurance]{color:end}
Restores stamina after using 4 skills.

{color:#35a6e6}[Cascade of Blows]{color:end}
Each weapon strike increases your weapon damage by 1%.
Cascade of blows stacks up to 10%.
The weapon attack that ends your string of attacks launches enemies into the air.

Charge forward, pushing enemies away.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Dash forward again towards a struck enemy.

Bends light into the focused area for {skill:180150020:remote:lifetime}.
Enemies in the focused area will be revealed, even if stealthed, and slowed by {skill:180150020:status:stat:mul:movespeed}%.
{color:#e45f5f}Lens Focus detects Stealth in a radius of 5m.{color:end}
{color:#35a6e6}Only one Spotlight can be active at a time. The passive effect will only strike each target once every 3 seconds.{color:end}

Blinds an enemy for {skill:180150030:status:durationtime} by concentrating the surrounding light through a camera flash.
Additionally, Flashbang slows by {skill:180150030:status:stat:mul:movespeed:1}% for {skill:180150030:status:durationtime:1}.
{color:#e45f5f}Non-Master targets will be terrorized instead.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Frostbite]{color:end}
Skill attacks apply frostbite, as well as every 6th weapon attack.
At 3 stacks, Eirna recovers 150MP and freezes her frostbitten target.

Casts a mass of razorsharp ice petals in a line, slowing struck enemies by {skill:180160010:status:stat:mul:movespeed}% for {skill:180160010:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Iceburst]{color:end}
Detonate the frozen petals for additional damage.

Whips up a destructive swirl of ice shards around yourself or any allied target for {skill:180160020:remote:lifetime}. 
Enemies in the storm take periodic damage and are slowed by {skill:180160020:status:stat:mul:movespeed:1}% for 5 seconds. 
{color:#35a6e6}Persists through tagging.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Harmony]{color:end}
On every third skill use, Vita creates a shield for 6 sec that absorbs damage.
Vita's Harmony shield restores 50 MP per sec and blocks 400 damage.
When the Harmony shield expires, Vita’s skills have their cooldown reduced by 20%.
{color:#35a6e6}Shield persists through tagging.{color:end}

Vita hits a note that resonates with the target.
The effect differs, depending on the target.
{color:#e45f5f}Cannot be used on creatures summoned by allies.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}Ally Effect: {color:end}
Shields {skill:180170020:status:stat:add:shield_defence} damage for {skill:180170020:status:durationtime}. 
{color:#35a6e6}Persists through tagging.{color:end}
{color:#e45f5f}Enemy Effect: {color:end}
Strips buffs and deals damage based on the number of buffs removed.

Wraps Vita in an aura of living energy that grants +{skill:180170040:status:stat:mul:movespeed:2}% movespeed for {skill:180170040:status:durationtime:2}.

{color:#35a6e6}Effect on ally: {color:end}
Allies are healed for {skill:180170040:status:regen:add:health} HP. 
{color:#e45f5f}Effect on enemy:{color:end}
Enemies are damaged and silenced for {skill:180170040:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Ringblade Launcher]{color:end}
Consumes 1 Ringblade per skill use. Up to 2 can be stored and 1 Ringblade is restored on every tenth hit with a skill. Multiple hits from the same skill count.

{color:#35a6e6}[Hindering Blade]{color:end}
{color:#e45f5f}Every 8 seconds, V-Merang fires a charged shot that deals bonus damage and binds for 1 second.{color:end}

{color:#e45f5f}Charging up weapon attacks increases Mass. Weapon attacks drain 10 Mass.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Conservation]{color:end}
When Bumaro is thin, movespeed is increased while weapon damage, skill power, and defense are decreased.

{color:#35a6e6}[Mass]{color:end}
When Bumaro is massive, it is slowed, while weapon damage, skill power, and defense are increased.

Clings to either an ally or enemy for {skill:180200010:status:durationtime}.
Causes different effects based on whether Bumaro has more or less HP than its target.
{color:#35a6e6}On Allies:{color:end}
 Lower HP: Grants {skill:180200012:status:stat:mul:movespeed:1}% movespeed.
 Higher HP: Restores {skill:180200012:status:regen:add:health:2} HP over time.
{color:#e45f5f}On Enemies:{color:end}
 Lower HP: Steals HP from enemy target.
 Higher HP: Slows by {skill:180200012:status:stat:mul:movespeed:3}%.

{color:#35a6e6}[Release]{color:end}
Recasting Cling will release your target.
{color:#e45f5f}Cannot use on other Bumaros.{color:end}
{color:#e45f5f}Cannot target players already being clung to.{color:end}

{color:#e45f5f}Consumes a maximum of 50 Mass when used.{color:end}

Bumaro alters its genetic makeup to spew acidic jelly in a {skill:180200020:remote:range} area around itself.
{color:#e45f5f}Consumes 0/25/50 Mass when used depending on Mass available.{color:end}
{color:#e45f5f}Damage and range are increased based on Mass spent.{color:end}

Bumaro stimulates the ooze colonies within it, recovering {skill:180200030:status:regen:add:health} HP and {skill:180200030:status:stat:add:rageregen} Mass every second for {skill:180200030:status:durationtime}. Cannot move while channeling.
{color:#e45f5f}Increases basic defense by 380%.
Able to cancel by committing any action.{color:end}

Bumaro splits into 3 copies.
Bumaro's copies are active for {skill:180200050:creature:lifetime} and will imitate the original Bumaro's skills or enhance the original's skill effects.
{color:#e45f5f}Mitosis does not work with Cling.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Hyper-Charged]{color:end}
After each skill use, Mondo's next attack within 5 seconds deals additional damage.
{color:#e45f5f}Lasts 1 attack.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Active Effect]{color:end}
Mondo's bot leaps to the target area and creates a cloaking field for {skill:180210010:status:durationtime:2}.
{color:#35a6e6}Effect persists through tagging.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Passive Effect]{color:end}
Periodically buffs Mondo's weapon damage by {skill:180210010:status:stat:mul:attack:1}% for {skill:180210010:status:durationtime:1}. 
{color:#e45f5f}Passive effect is deactivated while Modular Tech is in stealth.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Active Effect]{color:end}
Mondo's bot leaps to the target area and taunts nearby monsters for 3 seconds.
Slows enemies within 15m by {skill:180210020:status:stat:mul:movespeed:3}%.

{color:#35a6e6}[Passive Effect]{color:end}
Enemies struck by Bruiser Bot are slowed for 1 second.

{color:#35a6e6}[Active Effect]{color:end}
Mondo's bot fires {skill:180210030:leveltext:012345:4:6:5} mortar shells at the target area, dealing heavy damage.

{color:#35a6e6}[Passive Effect]{color:end}
Periodically fires mortar shells at enemies while following Mondo.
{color:#e45f5f}Passives don't trigger while the bot is stealthed.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Active Effect]{color:end}
Commands the bot to lunge forward and shield all allies at the target location. The shield stays active for {skill:180210040:status:durationtime:5} and blocks {skill:180210040:status:stat:add:shield_defence:5} damage.

{color:#35a6e6}[Passive Effect]{color:end}
Periodically shields Mondo from {skill:180210040:status:stat:add:shield_defence:4} damage.
{color:#e45f5f}Will not passively shield cloaked targets.{color:end}

Calls down an eagle strike every {skill:180220020:leveltext:012345:2:6:1.2} sec in the marked zone for {skill:180220020:remote:lifetime}, damaging all present enemies.
Grants visibility within the marked area in Titan Ruins.
{color:#e45f5f}Detects stealth in a radius of 5m.{color:end}

Lilu soars into the air with some help from a feathered friend, traveling up to 25m and gaining CC immunity.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Recast to cancel.

Lilu soars into the air with some help from a feathered friend, traveling up to 25m and gaining CC immunity.

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Recast to cancel.

Marks the target with a screeching crest for {skill:180220050:remote:lifetime}. The crest emits powerful sonic pulses, dealing damage to nearby enemies every 1.5 seconds.
{color:#e45f5f}Lilu can mark any target except herself.
The mark is removed if the target dies or tags out.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Incineration]{color:end}
Damaging skills cause Burning on their targets for 5 seconds.
Burning stacks up to 5 times.

{color:#35a6e6}[Heart of Fire]{color:end}
Kindling is not lost over time when out of combat.

Raises a shield and enters a defensive stance for 4 seconds. While the shield is raised, it blocks projectile attacks from the front and nullifies crowd control effects. Increases movespeed by 15% for 2 seconds. 
{color:#e45f5f}Shield is raised in the direction of your cursor and cannot turn. Skill use and attacks are disabled while blocking.
Cannot block area of effect attacks.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Right click to cancel.

{color:#35a6e6}[Shadow Hunter]{color:end}
Landing hits with skills grants 2.5 sec of stealth.
Slowed enemies take additional damage from weapon attacks.

{color:#35a6e6}[Charged Claws]{color:end}
The first weapon attack after using a skill leaves a lightning rift for 2 sec, dealing periodic damage to enemies touching it.

Fires a beam that follows your mouse cursor for {skill:180240010:remote:lifetime}, dealing heavy damage. Unable to move while firing.
{color:#e45f5f}Attempting other actions will cancel Ripper Beam.
Ripper Beam will only activate stealth on the last tick of damage.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Tenacious]{color:end}
Each time you are stuck by crowd control you will gain a buff that renders you immune to the next crowd control effect.

{color:#35a6e6}[Sohothin]{color:end}
The first and second hits of your weapon attack chain cause burning, while the third attack deals 20% additional damage.

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Invokes Mew's power to stun surrounding enemies right meow for {skill:180260010:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Lends Mew's power to convert weapon attacks into a long-range attack for 15 seconds.
{color:#e45f5f}Lasts {skill:180260010:weaponfirecount} attacks.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Invokes Kai's power to reflect {skill:180260020:status:stat:add:reflect_damage_ratio}% of incoming damage right meow back at the attacker for {skill:180260020:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Lends Kai's power to Kat and converts his weapon attack into short-ranged raking swipes for 15 sec while reflecting {skill:180260020:status:stat:add:reflect_damage_ratio}% of incoming damage at the attacker. Swipes refresh the reflect duration. 
Increases movespeed by {skill:180260020:status:stat:mul:movespeed:1}% and critical hit rate by{skill:180260020:status:stat:add:criticalrate:8}%.
{color:#e45f5f}Lasts for 7 attacks.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Invokes King's power to bind nearby enemies right meow for {skill:180260030:status:durationtime} and grant a {skill:180260030:status:stat:add:shield_defence:9} point shield to Kat. The shield can stack up to 5 times. Additionally, Kat's defense is increased by {skill:180260030:status:stat:mul:defence:3}% and Kat gains {skill:180260030:status:regen:add:health:3} HP recovery every second. 

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Uses King's power to convert Kat's weapon attacks into a splash attack around him for 15 sec. Attacks slow by {skill:180260030:status:stat:mul:movespeed:2}% for {skill:180260030:status:durationtime:2}. Slow effect stacks twice.{color:#e45f5f}
Lasts for 7 attacks.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Effect]{color:end}
Invokes Queen's power to grant {skill:180260040:status:stat:mul:attack}% damage and {skill:180260040:status:stat:mul:defence}% defense to Kat and allies hit by fans right meow for {skill:180260040:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Stance Change]{color:end}
Lends Queen's power to convert Kat's weapon attack into throwing bladed fans for 15 seconds.
{color:#e45f5f}Lasts for 7 attacks. Fans hang in the air for a brief moment before shooting off.{color:end}

Pounces onto an ally or enemy, knocking back enemies in your path and slowing hostile targets by 50% for 0.75 seconds. May be used twice before cooling down, and on the second cast Pounce! will knock down hostile targets.

On Allies:{color:end}{color:#35a6e6}
Removes 1 debuff and increases their movespeed by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:movespeed:4}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:4}. Recovers {skill:180260050:status:regen:add:health:5} HP over {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:5}.

{color:#e45f5f}On Enemies:{color:end}
Dispels a buff. Reduces your target's weapon damage by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:6}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:6}. You gain {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:7}% weapon damage for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:7}.

Pounces onto an ally or enemy, knocking back enemies in your path and slowing hostile targets by 50% for 0.75 seconds. May be used twice before cooling down, and on the second cast Pounce! will knock down hostile targets.

On Allies:{color:end}{color:#35a6e6}
Removes 1 debuff and increases their movespeed by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:movespeed:4}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:4}. Recovers {skill:180260050:status:regen:add:health:5} HP over {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:5}.

{color:#e45f5f}On Enemies:{color:end}
Dispels a buff. Reduces your target's weapon damage by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:6}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:6}. You gain {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:7}% weapon damage for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:7}.

Pounces onto an ally or enemy, knocking back enemies in your path and slowing hostile targets by 50% for 0.75 seconds. May be used twice before cooling down, and on the second cast Pounce! will knock down hostile targets.

On Allies:{color:end}{color:#35a6e6}
Removes 1 debuff and increases their movespeed by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:movespeed:4}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:4}. Recovers {skill:180260050:status:regen:add:health:5} HP over {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:5}.

{color:#e45f5f}On Enemies:{color:end}
Dispels a buff. Reduces your target's weapon damage by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:6}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:6}. You gain {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:7}% weapon damage for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:7}.

Pounces onto an ally or enemy, knocking back enemies in your path and slowing hostile targets by 50% for 0.75 seconds. May be used twice before cooling down, and on the second cast Pounce! will knock down hostile targets.

On Allies:{color:end}{color:#35a6e6}
Removes 1 debuff and increases their movespeed by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:movespeed:4}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:4}. Recovers {skill:180260050:status:regen:add:health:5} HP over {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:5}.

{color:#e45f5f}On Enemies:{color:end}
Dispels a buff. Reduces your target's weapon damage by {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:6}% for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:6}. You gain {skill:180260050:status:stat:mul:attack:7}% weapon damage for {skill:180260050:status:durationtime:7}.

[Ram's Wrath] After a casting time of {skill:180270050:status:durationtime:1} Ram releases a blast of power and binds all enemy Masters on the battlefield for {skill:180270050:status:durationtime}. Masters can swap out of the debuff before it binds them to dispel it.

{color:#35a6e6}[Bacchus's Recovery]{color:end}
Heals {skill:180270050:status:regen:mul:health:3}% max HP and restores {skill:180270050:status:regen:add:mana:3} MP.

Dashes in the target direction with a huge glove, blocking enemy projectiles.

{color:#35a6e6}[Fastball]{color:end}
Pitch a damaging ball in the target direction.

Designates the starting point of your salvo line of {skill:180290010:leveltext:012345:4:6:6} missiles.
{color:#e45f5f}A second reticle will appear to designate the direction of your salvo line.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Combo]{color:end}
Recast to fire the salvo for heavy damage.

Creates an energy field that can absorb damage.
The energy field nullifies {skill:180290040:status:shiledcount} strikes of damage for {skill:180290040:status:durationtime}. When the shield breaks after {skill:180290040:status:shiledcount} attacks, {skill:180290040:status:regen:add:mana:1} MP and {skill:180290040:status:regen:mul:health:1}% max HP are restored.
{color:#e45f5f}Does not nullify debuffs or crowd control. {color:end}
{color:#35a6e6}Persists through tagging.{color:end}

Scans the area, locking on up to 4 targets before firing missiles at them. Fires {skill:180290050:leveltext:012:4:345:6:6:8} homing missiles at locked on targets.
If there less than 4 targets in range, multiple missiles will strike the same target.
{color:#e45f5f}Multiple missing striking the same target have their damage reduced.{color:end}

Flies to and picks up an allied target.
Maia shields the protected target for {skill:180300010:status:durationtime}, absorbing {skill:180300010:status:stat:add:shield_defence} damage.

{color:#35a6e6}[Savior's Retreat]{color:end}
Dashes a moderate distance, dropping off the protected Master at the end of the dash. 
{color:#35a6e6}Shield persists through tagging.{color:end}

Places a recall pad that is tethered to Maia at the targeted area for {skill:180300020:remote:lifetime}. Allies who step on the pad are pulled towards Maia.
Maia's gains {skill:180300020:status:stat:mul:movespeed:1}% movespeed for {skill:180300020:status:durationtime:1} when she places the Recall Pad.
{color:#e45f5f}Tethered allies cannot pass through obstacles.{color:end}

