{color:#35a6e6}[Float like a Butterfly]{color:end}
Each time you hit an enemy with a skill, they are debuffed for 1.5 seconds and take 15% increased damage from your Weapon Attacks.

{color:#35a6e6}[Sting like a Bee]{color:end}
Upon successfully dodging an attack, any retaliatory attack will stun for 0.5 sec.
{color:#e45f5f}Lasts for 3 sec or 1 attack.{color:end}

Charges up Pancuga's Synd arm before launching a devastating punch in a line.
Launches all enemies you collide with into the air.
{color:#e45f5f}Distance covered ranges from 8m to 18m, and damage is increased up to 1.5x over 3 seconds of charging.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[High Roller]{color:end}
Increases your RNG Meter by 10 when picking up Bundles.

Once the RNG Meter is full, your next skill has an empowered effect.

{color:#35a6e6}[Nyerk Off]{color:end}
Every sixth Weapon Attack deals 80% additional damage, grants 10 RNG, and slows for 1 sec.

Throws an Enchantment Stone Bundle. When picked up, this Bundle increases Weapon Damage by {skill:180330010:status:stat:mul:attack}% and Skill Power by 200 for {skill:180330010:status:durationtime}. 

{color:#35a6e6}[High Roller]{color:end}
Bundles deal damage when thrown at enemies and instead increases weapon damage by 35% and skill power by 350.

Throws a Manastone Bundle. When picked up, this Bundle permanently increases weapon damage by {skill:180330030:status:stat:mul:attack}%, critical strike chance by {skill:180330030:status:stat:mul:attack}%, or skill power by 20, each stacking up to 10 times. Manastone Bundle effects persist through tagging.
{color:#e45f5f}Stacks reduced by 50% upon death.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[High Roller]{color:end}
Throws two Manastone Bundles.

Throws a Trickster Bundle that grants {skill:180330040:status:stat:mul:movespeed}% Movespeed for {skill:180330040:status:durationtime} when picked up by allies, or binds for {skill:180330040:status:durationtime:1} when picked up by enemies.

{color:#35a6e6}[High Roller]{color:end}
The Bundle deals damage when thrown at enemies and grants its effects in a 2.5m radius instead of only to whomever picked it up.

Calls down 4 lightning bolts that deal damage and slow struck enemies by {skill:180360010:status:stat:mul:movespeed}% for {skill:180360010:status:durationtime}.

{color:#35a6e6}[Heroism]{color:end}
Calls down 4 additional lightning bolts.

