{color:#35a6e6}[Triage]{color:end}
Summons a medical aid when your health drops below 30%. The aid stuns nearby enemies for {skill:180370000:status:durationtime} and restores 5% max HP per second every 5 seconds to nearby allied Masters.
{color:#e45f5f}Has a 2 minute cool down.{color:end}

{color:#35a6e6}[Catalyst of Sol]{color:end}
When your Sol power is full, skills gain additional effects.
{color:#e45f5f} Sol power is gained over time when Sol boost is used, or in increments of 10 when a target is struck by a skill.{color:end}

