{color:#35a6e6}[Pattern Transfer]{color:end}
Weapon attacks mark targets. After two strikes hit the same target, they will be marked with Xero's Engraving. Engraved enemies become the target of your skills.
{color:#e45f5f}Skills cannot be used if no targets are engraved. Additional attacks do not refresh the engraving duration. A maximum of 8 targets can be marked at the same time. Engravings persists through tagging.{color:end}

Your engraved patterns distort the minds of your targets.
For {skill:180380020:status:durationtime} Weapon Damage is reduced by {skill:180380020:status:stat:mul:attack}%, Skill Power by {skill:180380020:status:stat:add:skilldamage_ratio}%, and Defense by {skill:180380020:status:stat:mul:defence}%. 
{color:#e45f5f}Up to 8 cube patterns can be activated, but the skill cannot be used if no engraved targets are in range.{color:end}

Jump back {skill:180380030:actionbase:movehorizon} and pull in all engraved targets to your location.
Slows pulled targets by {skill:180380030:status:stat:mul:movespeed:5}% for {skill:180380030:status:durationtime:5}.
{color:#e45f5f}Cannot be used if no engraved targets are in range.{color:end}

Casts a prayer of resurrection on allies within a {skill:180390050:status:targetingrange} radius.

If marked allies are dealt lethal damage, Nura intervenes and immediately restores {skill:180390050:status:paramratio}% of their max HP.
{color:#e45f5f}When Divine Intervention is triggered, the target becomes invincible momentarilly. Persists through tagging.{color:end}

Ghost Widow changes into her Ghost form and summons 3 copies of herself. The ghosts last for {skill:180400040:stancedurationtime} seconds and explode in a radius of {skill:180400040:remote:range} when they disappear.

Ghost Widow becomes ethereal during this time, gaining immunity for {skill:180400040:stancedurationtime} seconds.
{color:#e45f5f}While ethereal, Ghost Widow cannot use weapon attacks, jumping, or skills.{color:end}

Enraptures a target for {skill:180400050:status:durationtime} and drains the life from them. 
Unleashes 3 blasts of  necrotic energy and generates two missiles of dark energy each time Ghost Widow deals damage.
{color:#e45f5f}Moving or attacking will cancel Soul Storm.{color:end}

The Titan releases its power by pounding the Titanic Hammer on the ground. 
A shield is created that absorbs 2000 damage for all allies nearby. Movespeed and Weapon Damage are greatly increased. The effect stays active for 10 seconds.
{color:#e45f5f}You cannot receive Incarnate effects.{color:end}

Places a shield on a friendly Tower or Core.
Absorbs {skill:180000110:status:stat:add:shield_defence} damage or lasts 15 seconds before dissipating.

{color:#e45f5f}The strength of the shield scales with your level.{color:end}

